Synthetic boards from the recorded fixtures for Apple, Google, Microsoft, NVIDIA, Netflix,
Meta, Amazon, Greenhouse, Ashby and Lever: unchanged, edited, new and closed postings give
the same snapshot and ledger, every posting is accounted for, detail requests drop to the
new and changed ones; silent edits are caught by the spread refresh age.

